DESCRIPTION
  Lightweight window manager for Wayland.
  Written in C with minimal dependencies and macro-based design.

FEATURES
  - Focus follows mouse
  - Move and resize windows with MOD + left/right mouse button
  - Configurable keybindings via config.h

BUILD
  meson setup build
  meson compile -C build
  meson install -C build

REQUIREMENTS
  - Wayland development libraries:
       - wayland
       - wayland-protocols
       - wlroots
       - libinput
       - libxkbcommon
  - GCC/Clang compiler
  - POSIX environment

CONFIGURATION
  Edit config.h before building to customize keybindings and behavior.

USAGE
  Start from .profile or display manager, for example:
    exec qqqwm
